# Byte-exact test fixtures must survive every OS checkout unchanged. GitHub's
# Windows runners ship git with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites LF to CRLF
# at checkout — any test comparing output byte-for-byte against a checked-in
# golden then fails on the `cli / matrix` windows-latest leg (and only there).
# `-text` opts these paths out of all line-ending conversion everywhere.
**/testdata/** -text
*.golden -text
# The Claude Code plugin ships the served qURL skill byte for byte; a daily
# check compares the two, so no checkout may convert its line endings.
plugins/claude-code/qurl/skills/qurl/SKILL.md -text
